Client: Northfield Festival

Scope: Full accessibility audit and remediation followed by legacy codebase modernisation and performance upgrades.

Key accessibility improvements: Decorative images properly defined, semantic markup fully implemented, contrast ratios optimised, navigation menus refactored, content reorganised for intuitive navigation, keyboard interface optimised.

Performance upgrades: Previous build tested as 100 Performance, 79 Accessibility, 96 Best Practices and 85 SEO with only 1/2 for Agentic Browsing on PageSpeed Insights [Link](https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/https-northfieldfestival-netlify-app/0trhcx065ppwihysr1g5l0?form_factor=desktop&category=performance&category=accessibility&category=best-practices&category=seo&category=agentic-browsing&hl=en-GB&utm_source=lh-chrome-ext). New site results: **100** Performance, **100** Accessibility, **100** Best Practices and **100** SEO with **2/2** for Agentic Browsing [Link](https://pagespeed.web.dev/analysis/https-www-northfieldfestival-org-uk/auykn9kg105xhaw0wy6hb2?form_factor=desktop&category=performance&category=accessibility&category=best-practices&category=seo&category=agentic-browsing&hl=en-GB&utm_source=lh-chrome-ext)
